window.T8_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"aside – downtown","cards":[{"w":"aside","p":"adv.","d":"to one side; out of the way","c":"在旁邊；到一旁","s":"The polite security guards stood aside to let the famous movie star and her family pass through the crowd.","t":"禮貌的保全人員站在一旁，好讓那位著名電影明星和她的家人穿過人群。"},{"w":"set aside","p":"v.phr.","d":"to save or reserve money, time, or feelings for a special purpose","c":"撥出；保留；拋開","s":"Fred decided to set aside his personal fears and walked bravely up to the front of the classroom.","t":"弗雷德決定拋開個人的恐懼，勇敢地走到教室前台。"},{"w":"aside from","p":"prep.phr.","d":"in addition to; except for","c":"除了…之外","s":"Aside from making advanced computers, this international technology company also manufactures high-end smartphones.","t":"除了製造先進的電腦之外，這家國際科技公司還生產高階智慧型手機。"},{"w":"bookcase","p":"n.","d":"a piece of furniture with shelves used for storing books","c":"書架；書櫃","s":"These clear printed instructions show the proper step-by-step way to put together the wooden bookcase.","t":"這些印製清晰的說明書展示了組裝木製書架／書櫃的正確步驟指南。"},{"w":"boot","p":"n.","d":"a sturdy shoe covering the foot and part of the leg; the luggage compartment of a car","c":"靴子；長靴；（英式）汽車行李廂","s":"Tony bought a sturdy new pair of leather boots before embarking on the difficult mountain hiking trip.","t":"東尼在展開艱難的登山健行之旅前，買了一雙堅固耐用的新皮靴。"},{"w":"boot up","p":"v.phr.","d":"to start up a computer operating system","c":"（電腦）開機；啟動","s":"It usually takes two or three minutes for my old laptop to boot up completely in the morning.","t":"早晨我的舊筆記型電腦通常需要兩到三分鐘才能完全開機。"},{"w":"give sb. the boot","p":"v.phr.","d":"to fire or dismiss someone from their job; to kick someone out","c":"解僱某人；開除某人","s":"The strict store manager decided to give the dishonest cashier the boot for stealing cash from the register.","t":"嚴格的店經理決定開除那位從收銀機偷竊現金的不誠實收銀員。"},{"w":"bowling","p":"n.","d":"an indoor game in which players roll a heavy ball down a lane to knock down pins","c":"保齡球運動","s":"In the exciting game of bowling, the maximum possible number of points a skilled player can score is 300.","t":"在刺激的保齡球運動中，技術精湛的選手所能獲得的最高滿分是三百分。"},{"w":"colorful","p":"adj.","d":"having bright or varied colors; full of interest and vivid character","c":"色彩繽紛的；生動精彩的","s":"The brightly painted colorful buildings along the canal give the historic European neighborhood a great deal of charm.","t":"運河沿岸粉刷得鮮豔奪目的五彩繽紛建築，賦予了這座歷史悠久的歐洲街區無限魅力。"},{"w":"considerable","p":"adj.","d":"notably large in size, amount, or extent; worthy of respect","c":"相當大的；相當多的；重大的","s":"A considerable amount of delicious food and dessert was left over after the grand celebration party ended.","t":"在盛大的慶祝派對結束後，剩下了相當大量的美味食物與甜點。"},{"w":"cooker","p":"n.","d":"an appliance or utensil used for cooking food","c":"炊具；爐具；電鍋","s":"This modern multifunctional rice cooker is wonderful because you simply push one button and it cooks perfect rice.","t":"這款現代多功能電子炊具／電鍋棒極了，因為你只需按下一顆按鈕，它就能煮出完美的米飯。"},{"w":"crab","p":"n.","d":"a crustacean with a broad shell, five pairs of legs, and two pincers","c":"螃蟹；蟹肉","s":"While walking along the sandy seashore, the excited children spotted a tiny hermit crab moving slowly across the rocks.","t":"沿著沙灘漫步時，興奮的孩子們看見一隻小巧的寄居蟹在岩石間緩慢移動。"},{"w":"downtown","p":"adv./n./adj.","d":"in or towards the central part or business district of a city","c":"在市中心；市中心商業區","s":"If you have free time tomorrow afternoon, we can take the metro downtown and go shopping together.","t":"如果你明天下午有空，我們可以搭捷運去市中心一起逛街購物。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"drag – kingdom","cards":[{"w":"drag","p":"v.","d":"to pull someone or something along forcefully with effort; to pass very slowly","c":"拉；拖曳；拖沓緩慢進行","s":"With great collective effort, the four police officers dragged the angry and shouting man out onto the sidewalk.","t":"在四名警官合力奮戰下，他們將那個憤怒大叫的男子拖到了人行道上。"},{"w":"drag on","p":"v.phr.","d":"to continue for too long in a tedious or tiring way","c":"拖延；沒完沒了地持續","s":"The complicated legal dispute continued to drag on for several months without reaching a fair resolution.","t":"這起複雜的法律糾紛拖延了好幾個月，卻依然沒有達成公平的解決方案。"},{"w":"dumpling","p":"n.","d":"a small lump of dough wrapped around meat or vegetables and boiled or fried","c":"水餃；小籠包；餃子","s":"These traditional Chinese steamed dumplings are generously filled with minced pork, fresh cabbage, and fragrant ginger.","t":"這些傳統的中國蒸水餃／餃子裡頭包滿了豐富的豬絞肉、新鮮高麗菜與香薑。"},{"w":"export","p":"v./n.","d":"to send goods to another country for sale; a commodity sent abroad","c":"出口；輸出（動詞/名詞）","s":"Many local fruit farmers export sweet pineapples and mangoes to neighboring Asian countries every summer.","t":"每年夏天，許多當地果農將香甜的鳳梨與芒果出口／銷往鄰近的亞洲國家。"},{"w":"import","p":"v./n.","d":"to bring goods into a country from abroad for sale; a commodity brought in","c":"進口；輸入（動詞/名詞）","s":"Because the small island lacks natural resources, it has to import oil and steel from overseas producers.","t":"因為這座小島缺乏自然資源，它必須從海外生產商進口石油與鋼鐵。"},{"w":"guidance","p":"n.","d":"advice or information aimed at resolving a problem or difficulty","c":"指引；指導；引導（不可數）","s":"Under the patient and professional guidance of her personal fitness trainer, Lisa managed to lose ten kilograms safely.","t":"在她個人健身教練耐心且專業的指導指引下，麗莎成功安全地減重了十公斤。"},{"w":"hourly","p":"adj./adv.","d":"done or occurring every hour; calculated per hour","c":"每小時的；按鐘點計算的（形容詞/副詞）","s":"The luxury airport hotel provides a reliable hourly shuttle bus service to transport travelers directly to the departure terminal.","t":"這家豪華機場飯店提供可靠的每小時一班的接駁公車服務，將旅客直接送達出境航廈。"},{"w":"hum","p":"v./n.","d":"to make a low, steady continuous sound; to sing with closed lips","c":"哼唱；發出嗡嗡低鳴聲（動詞/名詞）","s":"The quiet library study room was disturbed only by the soft, continuous hum of the air conditioner overhead.","t":"安靜的圖書館自修室裡，唯一能聽見的只有頭頂空調柔和且持續不斷的嗡嗡低鳴聲。"},{"w":"humid","p":"adj.","d":"marked by a relatively high level of water vapor in the atmosphere","c":"潮濕的；濕熱的","s":"The summer weather in Taipei is exceptionally hot and humid, which makes outdoor walking feel sticky and exhausting.","t":"台北夏天的天氣格外炎熱且潮濕，這讓戶外步行感覺黏膩且令人疲憊。"},{"w":"injury","p":"n.","d":"physical harm or damage suffered by a person or animal","c":"傷；傷害；損傷（可數/不可數）","s":"The lucky driver was wearing his seatbelt and managed to escape the highway crash without any serious injury.","t":"幸運的駕駛當時繫著安全帶，並成功在高速公路撞車事故中逃生且未遭受任何嚴重傷害。"},{"w":"kingdom","p":"n.","d":"a country, state, or territory ruled by a king or queen; a realm of nature","c":"王國；界（生物分類）","s":"The mighty medieval kingdom was vast and powerful, stretching across fertile valleys and high rocky mountains.","t":"那個強大的中世紀王國幅員遼闊且實力雄厚，橫跨肥沃的山谷與高聳的多石山脈。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"knight – part and parcel of","cards":[{"w":"knight","p":"n./v.","d":"a medieval warrior in armor serving a monarch; to grant someone the title of knight","c":"騎士；爵士；授以爵位（名詞/動詞）","s":"In the exciting fairy tale, a brave knight in shining metal armor rode his white horse to save the princess from the dragon.","t":"在那則精彩的童話故事中，一位身穿閃亮金屬盔甲的勇敢騎士騎著白馬從巨龍手中救出了公主。"},{"w":"ladder","p":"n.","d":"a piece of equipment consisting of two parallel vertical poles and steps used for climbing","c":"梯子；階梯（可數）","s":"You will certainly need a tall aluminum ladder if you want to rescue the frightened kitten stuck high up in the tree.","t":"如果你想把卡在高樹上受驚嚇的小貓救下來，你肯定需要一把高鋁梯。"},{"w":"mathematical","p":"adj.","d":"relating to, involving, or based on the science of mathematics","c":"數學的；精確嚴謹的","s":"Albert possesses a rare natural talent and can solve any complicated mathematical equation on the blackboard within seconds.","t":"艾伯特擁有罕見的過人天賦，能在幾秒鐘之內解開黑板上任何複雜的數學方程式。"},{"w":"mend","p":"v.","d":"to repair something that is broken, damaged, or torn; to improve or heal","c":"修補；縫補；癒合改善","s":"Vicki used some strong waterproof glue to mend the broken ceramic handle of her favorite morning coffee cup.","t":"維琪使用一些強力防水膠水來修補她最喜歡的早晨咖啡杯破損的陶瓷把手。"},{"w":"mend one's ways","p":"v.phr.","d":"to improve one's bad behavior, habits, or conduct","c":"改過自新；改邪歸正","s":"The patient school principal gave the mischievous teenage boy one final opportunity to mend his ways before suspending him.","t":"耐心的校長給了那個調皮搗蛋的少年最後一次改過自新的機會，才暫時沒讓他停學。"},{"w":"mighty","p":"adj.","d":"possessing great and impressive power, strength, or size","c":"強大的；強有力的；巨大的","s":"The ancient king assembled a mighty army composed of ten thousand disciplined soldiers to defend his border fortress.","t":"那位古代國王集結了一支由一萬名紀律嚴明士兵組成的強大軍隊，來守衛邊界要塞。"},{"w":"navy","p":"n.","d":"the branch of a country's armed services that conducts military operations at sea","c":"海軍；海軍部隊（常大寫）","s":"My older brother proudly enlisted in the national navy after graduating from high school and now sails across oceans.","t":"我哥哥高中畢業後自豪地加入了國家海軍，現在航行於各大洋之間。"},{"w":"neat","p":"adj.","d":"arranged in an orderly, clean, and tidy way; cleverly simple","c":"整潔的；整齊的；極好的","s":"Martin made sure that his appearance was completely clean and neat before leaving his apartment for the dinner date.","t":"馬丁在離開公寓前往晚餐約會之前，確保自己的儀表完全乾淨且整齊得體。"},{"w":"overseas","p":"adv./adj.","d":"in or to a foreign country, especially one across the sea","c":"在海外；到國外（副詞/形容詞）","s":"Because our company manufactures electronic goods for global consumers, the sales manager frequently travels overseas for client meetings.","t":"因為我們公司為全球消費者生產電子產品，業務經理經常前往海外與客戶開會。"},{"w":"parcel","p":"n./v.","d":"a package wrapped in paper for mailing; a piece of land; to divide into portions","c":"包裹；一片土地；分包（名詞/動詞）","s":"I was thrilled to receive a surprise postal parcel from my cousin in Canada that contained delicious maple candies.","t":"我收到加拿大表哥寄來的驚喜郵政包裹，裡面裝滿了美味的楓糖果，讓我欣喜萬分。"},{"w":"part and parcel of","p":"phr.","d":"an essential or unavoidable part of an experience, activity, or job","c":"…不可或缺的一部分；必然組成部分","s":"Dealing with occasional flight delays and tiring jet lag is simply part and parcel of traveling frequently for business.","t":"面對偶爾的班機延誤與疲憊的時差反應，只不過是頻繁出差不可或缺／不可避免的一部分。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"parrot – blow off steam","cards":[{"w":"parrot","p":"n./v.","d":"a brightly colored tropical bird capable of mimicking speech; to repeat mechanically without understanding","c":"鸚鵡；機械般盲目附和（名詞/動詞）","s":"Colorful tropical parrots living in South American rainforests are exceptionally talented at mimicking human speech.","t":"生活在南美洲熱帶雨林裡的色彩繽紛的鸚鵡，極擅長模仿人類說話。"},{"w":"pine","p":"n.","d":"an evergreen coniferous tree with needle-shaped leaves and woody cones","c":"松樹；松木","s":"One of our most cherished family Christmas traditions is gathering in the living room to decorate a fresh pine tree.","t":"我們家最珍視的聖誕節傳統之一，就是聚集在客廳裡裝飾一棵新鮮的松樹。"},{"w":"playful","p":"adj.","d":"fond of games and amusement; cheerful, lively, and lighthearted","c":"愛玩的；頑皮嬉戲的；幽默開朗的","s":"The golden retriever puppy is naturally energetic and playful, wagging its tail and chasing tennis balls across the yard.","t":"那隻黃金獵犬幼犬天性充滿活力且愛玩嬉戲，搖著尾巴在院子裡追逐網球。"},{"w":"pour","p":"v.","d":"to flow rapidly in a steady stream; to rain heavily; to serve a drink","c":"倒（液體）；傾盆降雨；湧入","s":"The polite flight attendant carefully poured hot black coffee into porcelain cups for all the passengers.","t":"禮貌的空服員小心翼翼地為所有乘客將熱黑咖啡倒入瓷杯中。"},{"w":"when it rains, it pours","p":"idiom","d":"proverb meaning that when bad things happen, they tend to happen all at once in large numbers","c":"禍不單行；屋漏偏逢連夜雨","s":"First my car broke down on the highway, and then I lost my wallet; truly, when it rains, it pours.","t":"先是我的車在高速公路上拋錨，接著我又丟了皮夾；真是屋漏偏逢連夜雨／禍不單行。"},{"w":"prevent","p":"v.","d":"to keep something undesirable from happening; to stop someone from doing something","c":"預防；防止；阻止","s":"Public health doctors across the globe are working tirelessly to prevent the rapid spread of the infectious virus.","t":"全球公共衛生醫師們不知疲倦地工作，以防止／阻止該傳染性病毒的快速蔓延。"},{"w":"roast","p":"v./n./adj.","d":"to cook food by prolonged exposure to heat in an oven or over fire; roasted meat","c":"烤；烘烤；烤肉（動詞/名詞/形容詞）","s":"The friendly waiter warmly recommended the delicious roast beef served with garlic mashed potatoes.","t":"熱情的服務生熱烈推薦搭配蒜香馬鈴薯泥的美味烤牛肉。"},{"w":"shiny","p":"adj.","d":"reflecting light brightly; clean, polished, and lustrous","c":"閃亮的；有光澤的；光潔的","s":"A special imported silk fabric was used to make this tuxedo, which is why it looks exceptionally smooth and shiny.","t":"這件燕尾服採用特殊的進口絲綢布料製作，這正是它看起來格外平滑且閃亮發光的原因。"},{"w":"situation","p":"n.","d":"a set of circumstances in which someone finds themselves; a state of affairs","c":"處境；情況；形勢（可數）","s":"Because the two close colleagues were angry at each other, eating lunch together created an uncomfortable situation.","t":"因為兩位平時要好的同事正在互相生氣，一起吃午餐造成了一種令人尷尬難堪的處境。"},{"w":"steam","p":"n./v.","d":"the vapor into which water is converted when boiled; to cook or emit steam","c":"蒸氣；水蒸氣；蒸煮（名詞/動詞）","s":"The kitchen window was completely covered with warm steam rising from the large pot of boiling beef soup.","t":"廚房窗戶完全被一大鍋滾燙牛肉湯升騰起的溫暖水蒸氣覆蓋。"},{"w":"blow off steam","p":"v.phr.","d":"to get rid of excess energy, anger, or stress through active physical exercise or recreation","c":"宣洩精力；發洩情緒；釋放壓力","s":"After spending eight stressful hours resolving difficult customer complaints at the office, Allison went for a long run to blow off steam.","t":"在辦公室度過了八個小時處理繁重客戶投訴的緊繃時光後，艾莉森去長跑來釋放壓力／宣洩情緒。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"stove – unique","cards":[{"w":"stove","p":"n.","d":"an apparatus for cooking or heating that operates by burning fuel or using electricity","c":"爐子；瓦斯爐；火爐（可數）","s":"Greg accidentally forgot to turn off the kitchen stove after making soup and almost caused a serious house fire.","t":"格雷格煮湯後不小心忘了關掉廚房的瓦斯爐／爐子，差點釀成嚴重的火災。"},{"w":"tend","p":"v.","d":"to be likely to behave in a particular way; to care for or look after someone or something","c":"傾向於；往往會；照顧；照料（動詞）","s":"Our shy domestic cat tends to hide silently under the sofa whenever unfamiliar guests come to visit our house.","t":"每當有不熟悉的客人來訪我們家時，我們害羞的家貓往往會／傾向於靜靜躲在沙發底下。"},{"w":"tendency","p":"n.","d":"an inclination toward a particular characteristic or type of behavior","c":"傾向；癖好；趨勢（可數/不可數）","s":"Mark has an unfortunate tendency to interrupt other people while they are speaking in important meetings.","t":"馬克有一個不幸的傾向／毛病，就是在重要會議中往往會在別人發言時打斷對方。"},{"w":"truthful","p":"adj.","d":"telling or expressing the truth; honest, accurate, and realistic","c":"說真話的；真實坦誠的","s":"The police detective looked into the witness's eyes and asked him to give a completely truthful account of the incident.","t":"刑警注視著目擊者的雙眼，要求他對該起事件做出完全真實坦誠的記述。"},{"w":"unique","p":"adj.","d":"being the only one of its kind; unlike anything else; extraordinarily special","c":"獨一無二的；獨特的；特別的","s":"If you want to present your mother with a truly unique birthday gift, you can design and craft one yourself.","t":"如果你想送給母親一份真正獨一無二的／獨特的生日禮物，你可以親自設計並手工製作一份。"}]}];
